        <div>
          <div class="mistake__title">{item.title}</div>
          <p>{item.body}</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    ))}
  </div>

  <h2 id="next-step">What to do next</h2>

  <p>
    Name the payer first, then the branch. Read five postings, run the future check and the four questions, ask for the approval in writing and visit a workshop or ward.
  </p>

  <p>
    For a first test, spend a focused stretch on one small real task in your target trade, as long as you need, and note whether you enjoy it. Some people decide quickly and others need a couple of months, and both are fine.
  </p>

  <p>
    The goal is a high-income skill portfolio, which means the right skill mix, proof of work, clear communication and a fit with how you work. That is what makes the decisions that unlock high income opportunities, and it supports an earlier path to financial freedom.
  </p>

